{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":11},"Siccità (Dry)","A Roma non piove da tre anni e la mancanza d’acqua stravolge regole e abitudini. Nella città che muore di sete e di divieti si muove un coro di personaggi, giovani e vecchi, emarginati e di successo, vittime e approfittatori. Le loro esistenze sono legate in un unico disegno beffardo e tragico, mentre cercano ognuno la propria redenzione. (Rome, Italy. The drought has been parching the city for three years now, and the lack of water has changed everybody’s life. While strict rules add to people’s misery, odd characters roam the streets of the capital. Outcasts, achievers, victims, and wrongdoers are all part of the same tragic picture, and they are all after the same thing: redemption.)",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"ecology","new start","fatherhood","technology","urban","homelessness","celebrity",{"type":12,"id":13,"slug":14,"title":15,"release":18,"filmType":22,"directors":23,"genre":42,"media":47,"synopsis":50,"production":53,"characters":56,"roles":102,"awards":141,"tags":3},"Film","IT2022_008","it2022-008-siccita",{"native":16,"english":17},"Siccità","Dry",{"type":19,"date":20,"year":21},"Theatrical release","2022-09-29",2022,"Fiction film",[24],{"id":25,"slug":26,"name":25,"birthYear":27,"deathYear":28,"gender":29,"nationality":30,"awards":31},"Paolo Virzì","paolo-virzi",1964,0,"Male identifying","Italy",[32,38],{"film":33,"year":34,"award":35,"category":36,"result":37},"it2016-006-la-pazza-gioia",2017,"Premio David di Donatello","Best Director","Awarded",{"film":39,"year":40,"award":35,"category":36,"result":41},"it2014-009-il-capitale-umano",2014,"Nominated",[43,44,45,46],"Disaster Film","Drama","Comedy","Multi-protagonist film",{"posterUrl":48,"trailerUrl":49},"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt13806164/mediaviewer/rm3736014593/?ref_=tt_ov_i","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p8wa3seGxAY",{"native":51,"english":52},"A Roma non piove da tre anni e la mancanza d’acqu